<p>This function gets the current game mode.
</p>
<div class="dascript" style="font-family:monospace; background-color:#F9F9F9; border: 1px dashed #2F6FAB; white-space:pre; line-height:1.25em; padding:1.0em;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> GetGameMode(<br />);</div>
<dl>
<dt>Parameters:
<dd>None
</dl><dl><dt>Returns:
<p><dd>a <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/GM" title="GM *">GM_*</a> constant on success, or <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/GM" title="GM *">GM_INVALID</a> on error.
</p>
</dl><dl><dt>Source:
<p><dd><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Script.ldf" title="Script.ldf">script.ldf</a>
